WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.416
(fun music)

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:10.583
- "Caillou" is the worst
show, it is the worst one.

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:13.672
(Caillou whining)

00:00:13.672 --> 00:00:14.701
- And we will.

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:17.040
- I hate "Caillou."

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:17.974
(sighing)

00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:20.000
- I despise "Caillou."

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.862
- Like "Caillou" needs to go.

00:00:21.862 --> 00:00:24.779
- Caillou is a bald little asshole.

00:00:27.276 --> 00:00:29.487
- I mean I love PBS but
"Caillou" creeps me out,

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:30.694
I think it's the way he talks.

00:00:30.694 --> 00:00:33.364
- Caillou's voice drives me crazy.

00:00:33.364 --> 00:00:35.397
- It's like one continuous whining show.

00:00:35.397 --> 00:00:38.131
- Whiny, whiny, "Mommy, I'm
tired, I wanna eat, Mommy."

00:00:38.131 --> 00:00:39.164
(whining)

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.822
- We have to get him down.

00:00:41.822 --> 00:00:45.138
- I mean I don't know why
but he is anti-authority,

00:00:45.138 --> 00:00:47.256
he's like a rebel with no reason,

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:49.830
he just does it to be a (bleep).

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.604
- Like where did he come
from and who created him

00:00:52.604 --> 00:00:55.083
and do they like him in Canada?

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:58.458
- I feel like on behalf of
French Canadians everywhere,

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.018
I have to apologize for "Caillou."

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:02.402
We will sign a petition to get it removed.

00:01:02.402 --> 00:01:03.704
- No!

00:01:03.704 --> 00:01:06.287
(upbeat music)

